# Disable all line-ending conversion. The auto-update feature compares SHA-256 hashes of
# local files against blobs served by raw.githubusercontent.com, so working trees, blobs,
# zips, and raw downloads must all be byte-identical regardless of anyone's core.autocrlf.
# Text files are committed with LF (one-time normalization done 2026-07-11); .cmd files
# are committed with CRLF (cmd.exe label parsing is unreliable with bare LF).
* -text
